  "In cijfers omvat het Witte Huis:\n\n6 verdiepingen waarvan 2 ondergronds\n5111 m² vloeroppervlakte\n132 kamers\n412 deuren\n147 ramen\n35 toiletten\n28 open haarden\n8 trappen\n3 liften\n1 bowlinghal\n1 filmzaal\n1 zwembad\n1 basketbalveld\n1 tennisveld\n1 staatsbalzaal\n\n\nGalerij\n\n\nZie ook\nWitte Huis (Moskou)\n\n\nExt": "In numbers, the White House includes:\n\n6 floors of which 2 underground\n5111 m² of floor space\n132 rooms\n412 doors\n147 windows\n35 toilets\n28 fireplaces\n8 stairs\n3 elevators\n1 bowling hall\n1 cinema room\n1 swimming pool\n1 basketball court\n1 tennis court\n1 state ballroom\n\n\nGallery\n\n\nSee also\nWhite House (Moscow)\n\n\nExt",
